{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Usually, there are many different ways to divide polynomials. Here, we will use the method of polynomial long division.\n\nNotice that the expression in the numerator is missing a $1^{\\text{st}}$ degree term. To avoid any confusion, let's add that term as $0x$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{array}{r}\n2x^2\\phantom{+0x+25}\n\\\\\nx-5|\\overline{2x^3-11x^2+0x+25}\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{2x^3-10x^2\\phantom{+0x+25}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n{}-x^2+0x+25\n\\end{array}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{array}{r}\n2x^2-\\phantom{1}x\\phantom{+25}\n\\\\\nx-5|\\overline{2x^3-11x^2+0x+25}\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{2x^3-10x^2\\phantom{+0x+25}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n{}-x^2+0x+25\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{{}-x^2+5x\\phantom{+25}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n-5x+25\n\\end{array}$","images":{},"replace":true,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{array}{r}\n2x^2-\\phantom{1}x-\\phantom{1}5\n\\\\\nx-5|\\overline{2x^3-11x^2+0x+25}\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{2x^3-10x^2\\phantom{+0x+25}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n{}-x^2+0x+25\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{{}-x^2+5x\\phantom{+25}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n-5x+25\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{{}-5x+25\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n0\n\\end{array}$","images":{},"replace":true,"widgets":{}},{"content":"We found that the quotient is $2x^2-x-5$ and the remainder is $0$, which means the answer is simply a polynomial (no expression of the form $\\dfrac{k}{x-5}$ ).\n\n$\\dfrac{2x^3-11x^2+25}{x-5}=2x^2-x-5$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Divide the polynomials.**  \n*The form of your answer should either be $p(x)$ or $p(x)+\\dfrac{k}{x-5}$ where $p(x)$ is a polynomial and $k$ is an integer.*\n\n$\\dfrac{2x^3-11x^2+25}{x-5}=$ [[☃ expression 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"buttonsVisible":"focused","considered":"correct","form":true,"functions":["f","g","h"],"key":0,"linterContext":{"contentType":"","highlightLint":false,"paths":[],"stack":[]},"simplify":false,"times":false,"value":"2x^{2}-x-5"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"static":false,"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
